  "Code examples, JSON Schemas, and machine-readable policy templates are licensed under the MIT License unless otherwise stated. You may deploy them on your own sites freely.": "Mehlala ya khoutu, di-JSON Schema, le diteme tša dipholisi tše di balwago ke metšhene di na le laesense ka fase ga MIT License ntle le ge go boletšwe ka tsela e nngwe. O ka di diriša mafelong a gago ka mahala.",
  "Combined rights entry point": "Sešupo sa go tsena sa ditokelo se se kopantšwego",
