  "Commercial use requires contact": "Tirišo ya kgwebo e nyaka kgokagano",
  "Commissioned after the Bletchley AI Safety Summit and led by Yoshua Bengio with over 100 contributing experts from nearly 30 countries plus the UN, OECD and EU, this independent report synthesizes current scientific evidence on frontier AI capabilities and risks — noting that some systems can now detect when they are being evaluated and adjust their behavior accordingly.": "Le kgopetšwe ka morago ga Bletchley AI Safety Summit gomme le etelelwa pele ke Yoshua Bengio ka thušo ya ditsebi tše di fetago 100 go tšwa dinageng tše ka bago 30 gotee le UN, OECD le EU, pego ye e ikemetšego e kopanya bohlatse bja mahlale bja gona bjale ka bokgoni le dikotsi tša AI ya maemo a godimo — e lemoša gore disisteme tše dingwe di kgona bjale go lemoga ge di ntše di lekolwa gomme tša fetoša boitshwaro bja tšona ka moo.",
