  "summarization — summaries, with or without attribution": "summarization — dikakaretšo, ka goba ntle le go bolela mothopo",
  "this site’s AI content rights policy": "pholisi ya lefelo le ya ditokelo tša diteng tša AI",
  "this site’s license catalog": "katalogo ya laesense ya lefelo le",
  "training / fine_tuning / distillation — model internalization tiers": "training / fine_tuning / distillation — maemo a go tsenywa ga mmotlolo",
  "training — model training and fine-tuning permission": "training — tumelelo ya thupelo ya mmotlolo le fine-tuning",
  "transformation — structured extraction and derivative works": "transformation — go ntšha ka mokgwa o hlophilwego le mešomo ye e tšweletšwago",
  "undeclared — high-risk pipelines may exclude": "undeclared — ditshepedišo tša kotsi ye kgolo di ka se akaretše",
  "verbatim_memory — whether exact reproduction is permitted": "verbatim_memory — gore na go hlangwa gape ka mo go nepagetšego go a dumelelwa",
  "versioned, citable, traceable": "e na le kgatišo, e ka tsopolwa, e ka latelwa",
  "“AICL: AI Ingestion & Capability Layer” now published in English as the canonical edition; the Chinese original manuscript remains available and both versions cross-link.": "\"AICL: AI Ingestion & Capability Layer\" bjale e phatlaladitšwe ka Seisemane e le kgatišo ya semmušo; tokumente ya Sekgena ya mathomo e sa dutše e hwetšagala gomme dikgatišo ka bobedi di hokaganya.",
  "“Protocolized Openness” confirmed as an English-language paper (with Chinese parallel passages) — no separate translation planned.": "\"Protocolized Openness\" e netefaditšwe e le pampiri ya Seisemane (ka ditemana tša Sekgena tša go sepelelana) — ga go na phetolelo ye e arogilego ye e beakantšwego.",
  "↑ live machine-readable policy of this site": "↑ pholisi ye e balwago ke metšhene ya lefelo le, ye e šomago gona bjale",
